# AgnoBuilder docker build context exclusions.
#
# This file is loaded by Docker when building ANY service in
# `docker-compose.yml` (the build context is `./` at the project
# root). Keeping it small + complete shaves build time and avoids
# shipping secrets / heavy artefacts into images.
#
# `.env` is excluded so a developer can fill `.env` for local dev
# without leaking it into the build context. `docker-compose.yml`
# re-injects the right vars explicitly via `env_file:` and `args:`.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python (backend/)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
backend/.venv/
backend/__pycache__/
backend/**/__pycache__/
backend/data/
backend/.runtime/
backend/.pytest_cache/
backend/.venv.bak/
backend/alembic/versions/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node (frontend/)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.vite/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.tsbuildinfo*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Git + IDE + logs (never want in a container image)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.log
*.swp
*.swo

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project-level artefacts (debug_server, runtime logs, local env)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.runtime/
debug_server/__pycache__/

# Secrets — never bake into image layers. Compose re-injects from
# the host's `.env` via `env_file:`.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Documentation + scripts not needed in the image
*.md
!backend/README.md
!frontend/README.md
LICENSE
CONTRIBUTING.md
images/
docs/